    "Condition : 1 - Application for approval of the reserved matters shall be made to the local planning authority not later than three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 92 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n",
